<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres says considering stock rights offer. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Benpres says considering stock rights offer. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to show that the rights issue is still being considered and the ratio is 1:2.5, not 1:2.25.)</p>
<p>Benpres Holdings Corp said on Friday it was considering a stock rights offer in the ratio of one for every 2.5 shares held.</p>
</text>
